# Sonar Strike: "tapped" alone is enough - Alpine Grizzly attacked on turn 4 and stays tapped through Bot1's turn 5, no longer
# attacking, so it is a legal target only as a tapped creature (CR 115.1). Bot1 controls no Bat (Bot2's Eyetwitch does not count:
# "you control"), so the Strike gains no life: Bot1 stays at 16 after the Grizzly's 4 damage (CR 119.3).

